### Modulo billing — planos, assinatura, consumo e faturas.
@api = http://localhost:8000
@token = SUBSTITUA_PELO_ACCESS_TOKEN
@tenant = SUBSTITUA_PELO_ID_DO_TENANT

### Catalogo de planos
GET {{api}}/functions/v1/billing/plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### Assinatura vigente, com o consumo medido contra os limites do plano
GET {{api}}/functions/v1/billing/subscriptions/current
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### Assinar (recusado se o tenant ja tem assinatura vigente)
POST {{api}}/functions/v1/billing/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "planCode": "starter" }

### Trocar de plano — a resposta traz o rateio do periodo restante.
### Descer de plano e recusado se o consumo atual nao couber nos novos limites.
POST {{api}}/functions/v1/billing/subscriptions/change-plan
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "planCode": "pro" }

### Cancelar ao fim do periodo, ou imediatamente com atPeriodEnd false
POST {{api}}/functions/v1/billing/subscriptions/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "atPeriodEnd": true }

### Registrar consumo. Com idempotencyKey, reenvios nao duplicam.
POST {{api}}/functions/v1/billing/usage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "metric": "api.calls",
  "quantity": 1250,
  "idempotencyKey": "lote-2026-09-09",
  "metadata": { "origem": "gateway" }
}

### Consumo somado por metrica no periodo da assinatura
GET {{api}}/functions/v1/billing/usage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### Emitir a fatura do periodo corrente
# @name fatura
POST {{api}}/functions/v1/billing/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "dueInDays": 10, "taxCents": 1495, "includeUsage": true }

###
@invoice = {{fatura.response.body.data.id}}

### Listar faturas
GET {{api}}/functions/v1/billing/invoices?status=open
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### Ver a fatura com as linhas
GET {{api}}/functions/v1/billing/invoices/{{invoice}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### Liquidar (a segunda tentativa e recusada: fatura paga e imutavel)
POST {{api}}/functions/v1/billing/invoices/{{invoice}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Cancelar a fatura
POST {{api}}/functions/v1/billing/invoices/{{invoice}}/void
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
